{"attack":"一边可爱地撒娇，一边靠近对手进行攻击，还能夺取对手携带的道具。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害。\n如果攻击方没有或失去携带物品，则会在本次战斗中获得目标的携带物品。\n\n不能偷取Ｚ纯晶。涉及到形态变化的道具（例如超级石）通常也不能偷取。\n如果攻击方因为防御方的铁刺特性、粗糙皮肤特性或凸凸头盔而陷入濒死状态，则该特效不会发动。\n如果防御方具有黏着特性或替身状态，则该特效不会发动。\n如果偷取到对方的生命宝珠，则该次攻击不会产生伤害加成，但攻击结束后自身会损失HP。\n除非是在野生对战中，否则偷取的物品在战斗结束后还原。\n野生宝可梦使用该招式只能造成伤害，不能偷取物品。\n在野生对战中，从野生宝可梦取得的道具会永久取得。\n这个招式不能被借助和挥指抽到。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Jigglypuff","Level":8},{"Name":"Wigglytuff","Level":0},{"Name":"Mankey","Level":0},{"Name":"Chansey","Level":0},{"Name":"Jynx","Level":16},{"Name":"Eevee","Level":0},{"Name":"Vaporeon","Level":0},{"Name":"Jolteon","Level":0},{"Name":"Flareon","Level":0},{"Name":"Snorlax","Level":0},{"Name":"Espeon","Level":0},{"Name":"Umbreon","Level":0},{"Name":"Teddiursa","Level":0},{"Name":"Ursaring","Level":0},{"Name":"Smoochum","Level":16},{"Name":"Blissey","Level":0},{"Name":"Zigzagoon","Level":9},{"Name":"Linoone","Level":9},{"Name":"Slakoth","Level":22},{"Name":"Slaking","Level":23},{"Name":"Skitty","Level":34},{"Name":"Happiny","Level":16},{"Name":"Munchlax","Level":12},{"Name":"Leafeon","Level":0},{"Name":"Glaceon","Level":0},{"Name":"Espurr","Level":18},{"Name":"Meowstic","Level":18},{"Name":"Sylveon","Level":0},{"Name":"Cutiefly","Level":30},{"Name":"Ribombee","Level":32},{"Name":"Greedent","Level":0},{"Name":"Ursaluna","Level":0},{"Name":"Lechonk","Level":15},{"Name":"Oinkologne form:male","Level":15},{"Name":"Oinkologne form:female","Level":12},{"Name":"Fidough","Level":8},{"Name":"Dachsbun","Level":8},{"Name":"Tinkatink","Level":11},{"Name":"Tinkatuff","Level":11},{"Name":"Tinkaton","Level":11}],"tutorMoves":["Rattata","Rattata form:alolan","Raticate","Raticate form:alolan","Mankey","Primeape","Cyndaquil","Quilava","Typhlosion","Sentret","Furret","Aipom","Snubbull","Granbull","Teddiursa","Ursaring","Poochyena","Mightyena","Slakoth","Vigoroth","Slaking","Skitty","Delcatty","Plusle","Minun","Illumise","Spoink","Grumpig","Spinda","Chimchar","Monferno","Infernape","Piplup","Prinplup","Empoleon","Bi